stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNINIT : Chưa init
    UNINIT --> IDLE : ble_init_stack()
    IDLE --> SCANNING : sync_cb()
    SCANNING --> CONNECTING : Tìm thấy UUID 0x18F0
    SCANNING --> ERROR : timeout
    CONNECTING --> ERROR : fail
    CONNECTING --> DISCOVERING : success
    DISCOVERING --> SUBSCRIBING : Tìm đủ TX + RX + CCCD
    SUBSCRIBING --> CONNECTED : CCCD = 0x0100
    CONNECTED --> SCANNING : disconnect (auto-reconnect)
    note right of CONNECTED : Gửi/Nhận OBD2<br>(Bước 6 lặp lại)